1
00:00:00,390 --> 00:00:02,550
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) It is Lily's birthday.

2
00:00:03,510 --> 00:00:05,010
She gets out of bed.

3
00:00:05,990 --> 00:00:07,790
Nobody says anything to her.

4
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:10,350
Her mom takes her to school.

5
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:13,210
Her friends do not say anything.

6
00:00:13,950 --> 00:00:16,290
The teacher does not say anything.

7
00:00:17,430 --> 00:00:18,490
Lily is sad.

8
00:00:19,570 --> 00:00:20,970
Lily walks home alone.

9
00:00:21,970 --> 00:00:23,310
She opens the door.

10
00:00:24,330 --> 00:00:26,950
Her friends and family are holding a cake.

11
00:00:26,950 --> 00:00:29,890
They say, surprise Lily!
